To change the RTL, thaw it here first (rule of ../../deprecated/fc32e1s_tiny/rtl/HISTORY): add rev N+1
with "thawed for <change>", status THAWED (rev N+1); change, re-verify the core and everything
built on it (appl/, example/), freeze again with a "frozen" line and the commit.
